      "title": {
        "en": "Dokąd? Na co?"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Dokąd?* is where to: *do* and a place in the genitive, *do teatru*, *do kina*, *do kawiarni*, *do parku*. *Na co?* is what to: *na* and an event in the accusative, *na przedstawienie*, *na film*, *na kawę*, *na spacer*."
      },
      "table": {
